{"id":"3fc5c21683829a15","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/368_BCK_组合逻辑.md","title":"368 BCK 组合逻辑","display":"368_BCK_组合逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"368-BCK-组合逻辑\">368 BCK 组合逻辑</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。固定可数无限变量集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。组合子集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Comb}_{BCK}=\\{B,C,K\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Comb}_{BCK}=\\{B,C,K\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 不是原始项构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项闭包\">2. 项闭包</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf{Comb}_{BCK}\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf{Comb}_{BCK}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{comb}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\">\\(\\operatorname{comb}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\">\\(M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、出现次数与替换\">3. 自由变量、出现次数与替换</h1>\n<p>自由变量函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV:\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV:\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV(\\operatorname{comb}(c))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV(\\operatorname{comb}(c))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=FV(M)\\cup FV(N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=FV(M)\\cup FV(N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>出现次数函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{occ}_x(M)=\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(M,x)\">\\(\\operatorname{occ}_x(M)=\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(M,x)\\)</span>，定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{occ}_x(\\operatorname{var}(y))=\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;x=y,\\\\\n0,&amp;x\\ne y,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{occ}_x(\\operatorname{var}(y))=\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;x=y,\\\\\n0,&amp;x\\ne y,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{occ}_x(\\operatorname{comb}(c))=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{occ}_x(\\operatorname{comb}(c))=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{occ}_x(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\\operatorname{occ}_x(M)+\\operatorname{occ}_x(N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{occ}_x(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\\operatorname{occ}_x(M)+\\operatorname{occ}_x(N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{BCK}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{BCK}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{BCK}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{BCK}(\\operatorname{comb}(c))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{BCK}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{BCK}(\\operatorname{comb}(c))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{BCK}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{BCK}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{BCK}(N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{BCK}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{BCK}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{BCK}(N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{BCK}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{BCK}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{comb}(c)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{comb}(c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{comb}(c)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{comb}(c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(M_0,M_1)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{app}(M_0[x:=N],M_1[x:=N]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{app}(M_0,M_1)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{app}(M_0[x:=N],M_1[x:=N]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha\\)</span> 是文字等同。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-根规约\">4. 根规约</h1>\n<p>根规约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{BCK}\">\\(\\to^0_{BCK}\\)</span> 由三族构成：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BXYZ\\to^0_{BCK}X(YZ),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BXYZ\\to^0_{BCK}X(YZ),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"CXYZ\\to^0_{BCK}XZY,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[CXYZ\\to^0_{BCK}XZY,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"KXY\\to^0_{BCK}X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[KXY\\to^0_{BCK}X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>不存在形如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"WXY\\to XYY\">\\(WXY\\to XYY\\)</span> 的根规约族。</p>\n<p>形式化地，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{BCK,B}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(B),X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(X,\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z))):X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{BCK,B}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(B),X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(X,\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z))):X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{BCK,C}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(C),X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),Y)):X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{BCK,C}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(C),X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),Y)):X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{BCK,K}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(K),X),Y),X):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{BCK,K}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(K),X),Y),X):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{BCK}=\\mathsf{Red}_{BCK,B}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{BCK,C}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{BCK,K}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to^0_{BCK}=\\mathsf{Red}_{BCK,B}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{BCK,C}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{BCK,K}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-闭包与转换\">5. 闭包与转换</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\">\\(\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\\)</span> 为满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{hole}_{BCK}\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\">\\(\\operatorname{hole}_{BCK}\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{appL}_{BCK}(C,P)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\">\\(\\operatorname{appL}_{BCK}(C,P)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{appR}_{BCK}(P,C)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\">\\(\\operatorname{appR}_{BCK}(P,C)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>填孔函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}:\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}:\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(\\operatorname{hole}_{BCK},M)=M,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(\\operatorname{hole}_{BCK},M)=M,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(\\operatorname{appL}_{BCK}(C,P),M)=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(C,M),P),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(\\operatorname{appL}_{BCK}(C,P),M)=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(C,M),P),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(\\operatorname{appR}_{BCK}(P,C),M)=\\operatorname{app}(P,\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(C,M)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(\\operatorname{appR}_{BCK}(P,C),M)=\\operatorname{app}(P,\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(C,M)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一步规约为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_{BCK}\n=\\{(\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(C,M),\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK},\\ M\\to^0_{BCK}N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_{BCK}\n=\\{(\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(C,M),\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK},\\ M\\to^0_{BCK}N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限规约对象集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RedDer}_{BCK}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\forall i&lt;n\\,M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK},\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\,M_i\\to_{BCK}M_{i+1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RedDer}_{BCK}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\forall i&lt;n\\,M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK},\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\,M_i\\to_{BCK}M_{i+1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\to^*_{BCK}N\">\\(M\\to^*_{BCK}N\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RedDer}_{BCK}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RedDer}_{BCK}\\)</span>，其首项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>。定义等式证明的单步规则关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{BCK}\n=\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\to_{BCK}N\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):N\\to_{BCK}M\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\equiv_\\alpha N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{BCK}\n=\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\to_{BCK}N\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):N\\to_{BCK}M\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\equiv_\\alpha N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等式证明是有限非空序列，连续两项对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{BCK}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{BCK}\\)</span> 的一个实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=_{BCK}N\">\\(M=_{BCK}N\\)</span> 表示存在此类等式证明。\n初始项族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{BCK}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{comb}(c):c\\in\\mathsf{Comb}_{BCK}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{BCK}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{comb}(c):c\\in\\mathsf{Comb}_{BCK}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等式证明对象集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{BCK}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\forall i&lt;n\\ M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK},\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\ ((\\langle M_i\\rangle,M_{i+1})\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{BCK})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Der}_{BCK}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\forall i&lt;n\\ M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK},\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\ ((\\langle M_i\\rangle,M_{i+1})\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{BCK})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{BCK}=(\\operatorname{comb}(B),\\operatorname{comb}(C),\\operatorname{comb}(K),\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK},\\to^0_{BCK}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{BCK}=(\\operatorname{comb}(B),\\operatorname{comb}(C),\\operatorname{comb}(K),\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK},\\to^0_{BCK}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{comb}(W)\\notin\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\">\\(\\operatorname{comb}(W)\\notin\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>规约与证明关系均作为类型化关系给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{BCK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK},\n\\quad\n\\to_{BCK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{RedDer}_{BCK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}^{&lt;\\omega},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Der}_{BCK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to^0_{BCK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK},\n\\quad\n\\to_{BCK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{RedDer}_{BCK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}^{&lt;\\omega},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Der}_{BCK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个证明步必须是三族根规约的应用上下文闭包、其逆向，或文字等同；不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 项与复制根规约，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}\">\\(\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}\\)</span> 记录这一目标差异。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-无复制证书\">6. 无复制证书</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NoCopy}_{BCK}\n=\n\\{(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}^2:\n\\forall x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\ \n\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(N,x)\\le\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(M,x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NoCopy}_{BCK}\n=\n\\{(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}^2:\n\\forall x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\ \n\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(N,x)\\le\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(M,x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_X=\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(X,a)\">\\(n_X=\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(X,a)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_Y,n_Z\">\\(n_Y,n_Z\\)</span> 以同一方式定义。三族根的左右端出现次数分别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B:\\ (n_X+n_Y+n_Z,\\ n_X+n_Y+n_Z),\\qquad\nC:\\ (n_X+n_Y+n_Z,\\ n_X+n_Z+n_Y),\\qquad\nK:\\ (n_X+n_Y,\\ n_X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B:\\ (n_X+n_Y+n_Z,\\ n_X+n_Y+n_Z),\\qquad\nC:\\ (n_X+n_Y+n_Z,\\ n_X+n_Z+n_Y),\\qquad\nK:\\ (n_X+n_Y,\\ n_X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由自然数加法可得（此处为上述三种计算的结论）</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{BCK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{NoCopy}_{BCK}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to^0_{BCK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{NoCopy}_{BCK}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ext}:\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{ext}:\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ext}(\\operatorname{hole}_{BCK},a)=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ext}(\\operatorname{hole}_{BCK},a)=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ext}(\\operatorname{appL}_{BCK}(C,P),a)=\\operatorname{ext}(C,a)+\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(P,a),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ext}(\\operatorname{appL}_{BCK}(C,P),a)=\\operatorname{ext}(C,a)+\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(P,a),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ext}(\\operatorname{appR}_{BCK}(P,C),a)=\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(P,a)+\\operatorname{ext}(C,a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ext}(\\operatorname{appR}_{BCK}(P,C),a)=\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(P,a)+\\operatorname{ext}(C,a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的三条形成子句归纳：hole 情形为加零；appL 和 appR 情形分别用出现次数的应用子句和上述对应 ext 子句，得到</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(C,M),a)\n=\\operatorname{ext}(C,a)+\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(M,a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK}(C,M),a)\n=\\operatorname{ext}(C,a)+\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(M,a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此在根的两端加入同一个自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ext}(C,a)\">\\(\\operatorname{ext}(C,a)\\)</span>，保持不等式，得到</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_{BCK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{NoCopy}_{BCK}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_{BCK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{NoCopy}_{BCK}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这是关于有向一步规约的逐变量计数结论；等式证明允许逆向步，因此不声称 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=_{BCK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{NoCopy}_{BCK}\">\\(=_{BCK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{NoCopy}_{BCK}\\)</span>。任意一对有限项的 NoCopy 检查只需检查 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV(M)\\cup FV(N)\">\\(FV(M)\\cup FV(N)\\)</span>，其余变量的两个计数都为零。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-有限证明与文字等同\">7. 有限证明与文字等同</h1>\n<p>BCK 没有绑定构造子，固定</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{BCK}=\\{(M,M):M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_\\alpha^{BCK}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{BCK}=\\{(M,M):M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_\\alpha^{BCK}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{BCK}(M,N)\n=\n\\{\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{BCK}:\\pi_0=M\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=N\\};\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{BCK}(M,N)\n=\n\\{\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{BCK}:\\pi_0=M\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=N\\};\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=_{BCK}N\">\\(M=_{BCK}N\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{BCK}(M,N)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{BCK}(M,N)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-最终系统\">8. 最终系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{BCK}=(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Comb}_{BCK},\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK},FV,\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK},\\operatorname{BV}_{BCK},\\operatorname{Sub}_{BCK},\\equiv_\\alpha^{BCK},\\mathsf{NoCopy}_{BCK},\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{BCK},\\mathsf{Delta}_{BCK},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK},\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK},\\to^0_{BCK},\\to_{BCK},\\mathsf{RedDer}_{BCK},\\to^*_{BCK},\\mathsf{Rule}_{BCK},\\mathsf{Der}_{BCK},\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{BCK},=_{BCK}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{BCK}=(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Comb}_{BCK},\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK},FV,\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK},\\operatorname{BV}_{BCK},\\operatorname{Sub}_{BCK},\\equiv_\\alpha^{BCK},\\mathsf{NoCopy}_{BCK},\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{BCK},\\mathsf{Delta}_{BCK},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{BCK},\\operatorname{plug}_{BCK},\\to^0_{BCK},\\to_{BCK},\\mathsf{RedDer}_{BCK},\\to^*_{BCK},\\mathsf{Rule}_{BCK},\\mathsf{Der}_{BCK},\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{BCK},=_{BCK}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"8.1-完成核对\">8.1 完成核对</h2>\n<p>本文给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C,K\">\\(B,C,K\\)</span> 的项闭包、出现次数、替换和规约；目标差异是排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 以及排除复制根规约。系统不含类型判断或解释结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"368-BCK-组合逻辑","text":"368 BCK 组合逻辑","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-项闭包","text":"2. 项闭包","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、出现次数与替换","text":"3. 自由变量、出现次数与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-根规约","text":"4. 根规约","level":1},{"id":"5.-闭包与转换","text":"5. 闭包与转换","level":1},{"id":"6.-无复制证书","text":"6. 无复制证书","level":1},{"id":"7.-有限证明与文字等同","text":"7. 有限证明与文字等同","level":1},{"id":"8.-最终系统","text":"8. 最终系统","level":1},{"id":"8.1-完成核对","text":"8.1 完成核对","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Comb}_{BCK}=\\{B,C,K\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathsf{Comb}_{BCK}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{comb}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}","display":false},{"tex":"M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}","display":false},{"tex":"FV:\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}).","display":true},{"tex":"FV(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV(\\operatorname{comb}(c))=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"FV(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=FV(M)\\cup FV(N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{BCK}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbb N","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{occ}_x(M)=\\operatorname{occ}_{BCK}(M,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{occ}_x(\\operatorname{var}(y))=\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&x=y,\\\\\n0,&x\\ne y,\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{occ}_x(\\operatorname{co